      "author": "Jay Peters",
      "publishedAt": "2026-05-16T12:00:00.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/05/ss_207625ae80acf9b85f7ab91e0e806cabb892c69f.1920x1080.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,3.4613147178592,100,93.077370564282",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/games/925580/mixtape-review-ps5-xbox-series-x-s-nintendo-switch-2-pc",
