      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/05/268521_Age_verification_bills_have_a_Linux_issue_CVirginia.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,10.732984293194,100,78.534031413613",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/930573/age-verification-bills-linux-open-source",
