      "title": "Classic 7 is a Windows 10 LTSC mod to look 1:1 to Windows 7",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://classic7.lol/\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48132030\nPoints: 99\n# Comments: 85",
      "body": "Classic 7 is a Windows 10 (IoT Enterprise LTSC 2021) modification made to look 1:1 to Windows 7.\nIt has all of the goodies that Windows 7 had along with some extras included!\nClassic 7 features a 1:1 OOBE recreation, meaning it'll feel just like your PC simplified once more.\nWhat features does Classic 7 contain?\nClassic 7 comes with most of the features that Windows 7 had, along with some exceptions that may or may not happen to be included in the near future.\nSome features included from Windows 7 are:\nAero Glass! Preview of Aero working\nSupport for .themepack files from Windows 7! Preview of .themepack files working\nAll of the beloved gadgets you remember! Preview of gadgets working on the desktop\nWindows Media Center is fully intact and functional! Preview of Media Center playing a file from Sample Music\nAnd of course, the beautiful theme elements from Windows 7! Preview of common controls used in Windows\nSome features that aren't brought back from Windows 7 are:\n3D animations for windows, this includes opening, closing, minimizing and maximizing a window.\nFlip 3D isn't brought back as no one has made a port just yet, the alternatives for Flip 3D are horrible and not recommended.\nSome system applications / gadgets may not work due to incompatibilities between Windows 7 and Windows 10.\nWhat are you waiting for?\nIf you like what you see, why not try Classic 7 out for a test drive? Download Classic 7 with the button below!",
