      "id": "theverge-2026-05-13-everything-at-the-criterion-collection-is-30-percent-off-rig",
      "title": "Everything at The Criterion Collection is 30 percent off right now",
      "summary": "Classics as well as newer films like Anora are on sale. | Image: Neon\t\n\nIf you’ve been meaning to grow your physical movie collection, now’s a good time to do it. Through May 25th, The Criterion Collection is taking 30 percent off every disc on its site, including standard Blu-rays, 4K releases, box sets, and even films that are currently only available to preorder. The sale spans every category C",
      "body": "If you’ve been meaning to grow your physical movie collection, now’s a good time to do it. Through May 25th, The Criterion Collection is taking 30 percent off every disc on its site, including standard Blu-rays, 4K releases, box sets, and even films that are currently only available to preorder. The sale spans every category Criterion is known for, from Hollywood classics and international cinema to indie favorites, documentaries, concert films, and arthouse movies.\nIn total, more than 1,000 titles from over 600 directors are discounted. You can browse the full sale here, but below, we’ve highlighted some of our favorites, including newer award winners like Anora, box sets like The Wes Anderson Archive, cult classics like The Breakfast Club, and international films like High and Low.\n[Product: Isle of Dogs | https://www.amazon.com/Isle-Dogs-Criterion-Collection-Blu-ray/dp/B0FDJRKCPN/?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F34340-isle-of-dogs]\n[Product: The Wes Anderson Archive | https://www.amazon.com/Wes-Anderson-Archive-Twenty-Five-Collection/dp/B0FBF1YJ2J?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.barnesandnoble.com%2Fw%2Fdvd-the-wes-anderson-archive-ten-films-twenty-five-years-criterion-collection%2F1147505197, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Fboxsets%2F8208-the-wes-anderson-archive-ten-films-twenty-five-years]\n[Product: Anora | https://www.amazon.com/Anora-Criterion-Collection-Blu-ray-Baker/dp/B0DTB73R2G/?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F34891-anora, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F34891-anora]\n[Product: Killers of the Flower Moon | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F35293-killers-of-the-flower-moon, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F35293-killers-of-the-flower-moon]\n[Product: Altered States | https://www.amazon.com/Altered-States-Criterion-Collection-UHD/dp/B0FHSC1TK8/ref=sr_1_1?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.barnesandnoble.com%2Fw%2Fdvd-altered-states-ken-russell%2F3630445%3Fean%3D0715515321112, https://www.amazon.com/Altered-States-Criterion-Collection-UHD/dp/B0FHSC1TK8/ref=sr_1_1?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Chungking Express | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F226-chungking-express, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F226-chungking-express]\n[Product: The Breakfast Club | https://www.amazon.com/Breakfast-Club-Criterion-Collection-UHD/dp/B0FN4V6GK8/ref=tmm_frk_swatch_0?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F29272-the-breakfast-club, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F29272-the-breakfast-club]\n[Product: High and Low | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F543-high-and-low]\n[Product: This Is Spinal Tap | https://www.amazon.com/This-Spinal-Tap-Criterion-Collection/dp/B0FDHZB73X/ref=tmm_frk_swatch_0?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F317-this-is-spinal-tap, https://www.amazon.com/This-Spinal-Criterion-Collection-Blu-ray/dp/B0FDJL7CG7/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Parasite | https://www.amazon.com/Parasite-Blu-ray-Kang-Ho-Song/dp/B07YTDYDYB/?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.criterion.com%2Ffilms%2F30619-parasite]",
