Riddell-Carpenter - MP for Suffolk CoastalTim Roca - MP for MacclesfieldMatt Rodda - MP for Reading CentralSam Rushworth - MP for Bishop AucklandOliver Ryan - MP for BurnleyMichelle Scrogham - MP for Barrow & FurnessMark Sewards - MP for Leeds South West & MorleyBaggy Shanker - MP for Derby SouthTulip Siddiq - MP for Hampstead & HighgateAndy Slaughter - MP for Hammersmith & ChiswickJohn Slinger - MP for RugbyNick Smith - MP for Blaenau Gwent & RhymneyAlistair Strathern - MP for HitchinAlan Strickland - MP for Newton Aycliffe & SpennymoorKirsteen Sullivan - MP for Bathgate & LinlithgowLauren Sullivan - MP for GraveshamPeter Swallow - MP for BracknellAlison Taylor - MP for Paisley & Renfrewshire NorthDavid Taylor - MP for Hemel HempsteadJessica Toale - MP for Bournemouth WestMatthew Turmaine - MP for WatfordLiz Twist - MP for Blaydon & ConsettValerie Vaz - MP for Walsall & BloxwichChris Vince - MP for HarlowMichelle Welsh - MP for Sherwood ForestMatt Western - MP for Warwick & LeamingtonJohn Whitby - MP for Derbyshire DalesSean Woodcock - MP for BanburySteve Yemm - MP for MansfieldDaniel Zeichner - MP for CambridgeRupa Huq, the MP for Ealing Central & Acton, had also been on the list. However, she has since posted on X that she was \"surprised\" to see her name and had not \"either signed any letter supporting the PM or called for the PM to go\".",
