      "summary": "Her best friend's journey into marriage, challenges Zoe's own attitude toward relationships",
      "body": "Homepage    Accessibility links   Skip to content   Accessibility Help     BBC Account      Notifications        Home            News            Sport            Weather            iPlayer            Sounds            Bitesize     CBeebies     CBBC     Food         Home     News     Sport     Business     Technology     Health     Culture     Arts     Travel     Earth     Audio     Video     Live               More menu             Search iPlayer              Home            News            Sport            Weather            iPlayer            Sounds            Bitesize     CBeebies     CBBC     Food        Home     News     Sport     Business     Technology     Health     Culture     Arts     Travel     Earth     Audio     Video     Live         Close menu\niPlayer NavigationiPlayer Accessibility HelpFIFA World Cup;;Channels Sub NavigationBBC OneBBC TwoBBC ThreeBBC FourBBC Radio 1CBBCCBeebiesBBC ScotlandBBC NewsBBC ParliamentBBC AlbaS4CCategoriesCategory Sub NavigationDrama & SoapsFilmsComedyDocumentariesSportNewsEntertainmentMusicFoodLifestyleHistoryScience & NatureArtsFrom the ArchiveAudio DescribedSignedNorthern IrelandScotlandWalesCBeebiesCBBCDrama & SoapsFilmsComedyDocumentariesSportNewsEntertainmentMusicFoodLifestyleHistoryScience & NatureArtsFrom the ArchiveAccessible alternative formatsAudio DescribedSignedRegionsNorthern IrelandScotlandWalesChildren’sCBeebiesCBBCA-ZTV GuideWatchlistHomeWhat's Love Got to Do with It?What's Love Got to Do with It?Contains some strong language.In London, an award-winning film-maker documents her best friend's journey into an assisted marriage in line with his family's Pakistani heritage. Duration1h 43mFirst shown2022Available for 23 daysWatchlistAudio DescribedSign LanguageMore Like ThisMore Like This EpisodesKnocked UpKatherine Heigl and Seth Rogen star. A one-night stand turns into a lifetime commitment2h 2mDenmarkA great place to start a new life… sentence. Rafe Spall as a down-on-his-luck Welshman1h 25mFour Weddings and a FuneralHe's quite engaging. She's already engaged. Hugh Grant in Richard Curtis' timeless tale1h 52mHave I Got News for You7/10 Victoria Coren Mitchell hosts with Bella Hull and Karl Turner MP on the panel29 minsQuiz LadySandra Oh and Awkwafina star. Sisters must win a game show to get their stolen dog back1h 36mSt Denis MedicalIt's quite the operation. Do an eclectic medical team have patience for their patients?Chaos WalkingTom Holland stars. Prentisstown isn’t like other towns – there are no secrets. Until now…1h 37mThirteen LivesFinding them was just the beginning. Ron Howard's retelling of the 2018 Thai cave rescue2h 15mRoad HousePatrick Swayze stars in the 80s cult classic. One bar. One bouncer. All-out chaos1h 49mThe Woman in BlackDo you believe in ghosts? A vengeful spirit terrorises the locals of a remote village1h 28mThe Miracle ClubMaggie Smith leads an all-star cast. A life‑changing trip might answer all their prayers1h 23mMintSparks will fly. A criminally good story of passion, heartbreak and love laced with fear",
